    "image_text_block_QCQJHR": {
      "type": "image-text-block",
      "name": "t:sections.image_text_block.presets.default.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/about4.jpg",
        "title": "",
        "description": "<h3>The Creators</h3>\n<br>\nCold ral is led by two brothers with different backgrounds and a shared refusal of the unnecessary. This dual perspective shapes a restrained approach to design. We create fewer pieces, but each one is designed with intent. The collections are unisex, monochrome and free of visible logos, allowing the garment to exist without imposed identity.\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<h3>Design and Development</h3>\n<br>\nEvery cut, every proportion and every detail is the result of a methodical process carried out between Paris and our partner workshops. The goal is not to follow seasonal impulses, but to refine silhouettes that adapt naturally to everyday movement and modern life.",
