    "image_text_block_ffwMyT": {
      "type": "image-text-block",
      "name": "t:sections.image_text_block.presets.default.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/about6.jpg",
        "title": "",
        "description": "<h3>Materials and Production</h3>\n<br>\nWe work alongside textile specialists who share our commitment to quality, traceability and durability. Most of our fabrics are certified and selected for their structure, comfort and ability to endure over time. Materials are chosen with the same discipline as the designs themselves.\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n\n<h3>Our Ethos</h3>\n<br>\n\nOur mission is simple. To build a reduced, coherent and durable wardrobe. Not to dress a single season, but to accompany a way of living. Cold ral evolves quietly, valuing structure, simplicity and consistency. A return to essential forms, reinterpreted for today.",
